-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-languages h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">ترجمه حرفه‌ای و دقیق</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">ترجمه تخصصی انواع محتوا توسط زبان‌دانان حوزه کسب‌وکار شما، با رعایت اصول نگارشی، فرهنگی و ساختار جملات بومی.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>دقت بالا</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>کدنویسی فرهنگی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تطابق با برند</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">بومی‌سازی خلاقانه</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">انطباق کامل متن با فرهنگ، بازار هدف، ارزش‌های اجتماعی و نیازمندی‌های بازاریابی محلی هر زبان.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بازدهی فرهنگی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ارتباط مؤثر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نرخ تبدیل بالاتر</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">حفظ ساختار سئو در ترجمه</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">بهینه‌سازی متون چندزبانه برای جستجوی گوگل و الگوریتم‌های محلی با حفظ رتبه کلمات کلیدی استراتژیک.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رتبه جهانی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ترافیک بین‌المللی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بومی‌سازی فنی</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">تضمین کیفیت و کنترل دو مرحله‌ای</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">مرور اولیه توسط مترجم تخصصی، سپس کنترل کیفیت توسط متخصص زبان‌شناسی برای اطمینان از کیفیت عالی.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>کیفیت تضمینی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>دقت دوگانه</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رضایت ۱۰۰%</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">انواع <span class=\"gradient-text\">محتوای قابل ترجمه</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">پوشش کامل انواع محتوا از وب‌سایت تا مستندات قانونی</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">وب‌سایت و اپلیکیشن</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">ترجمه کامل صفحات، اپلیکیشن‌ها و رابط کاربری</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>صفحات وب‌سایت</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>اپلیکیشن موبایل</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>پنل مدیریت</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">محتوای بازاریابی</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">ترجمه کتاب‌های راهنما، کاتالوگ و متون تبلیغاتی</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>بروشورها</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>کاتالوگ محصولات</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>کمپین‌های تبلیغاتی</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">مستندات فنی</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">ترجمه اسناد، راهنماها و محتوای آموزشی</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>راهنمای کاربری</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>مطالعات موردی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>اسناد فنی</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">محتوای حقوقی</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">ترجمه قراردادها، شرایط استفاده و اسناد قانونی</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>شرایط خدمات</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>قراردادها</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>اسناد قانونی</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">مزایای ترجمه و <span class=\"gradient-text\">بومی‌سازی حرفه‌ای</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">گسترش جهانی کسب‌وکار با مترجمین متخصص حوزه شما</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-green-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">امکان ورود به بازارهای جدید ملی و بین‌المللی با مخاطبان میلیونی</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-green-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">حفظ انسجام کامل برند در تمام زبان‌ها و بازارها</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-green-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">افزایش رتبه سایت در نتایج جستجوی کشورهای هدف</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-green-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">ارتباط مؤثر و ایجاد اعتماد سریع‌تر با مشتریان بین‌المللی</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-green-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">کاهش هزینه‌های بازاریابی محلی با محتوای آماده‌سازی شده</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-green-600\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">مزیت رقابتی ماندگار نسبت به رقبای محلی</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-50 to-green-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">فرآیند <span class=\"gradient-text\">ترجمه تخصصی</span> عصر سئو</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600\">رویکرد علمی ۴ مرحله‌ای برای ترجمه دقیق و با کیفیت</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white/80 rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-green-700\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">ارزیابی و تحلیل</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">بررسی محتوای پایه، زبان هدف و نیازهای فرهنگی</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white/80 rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-green-700\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">تخصیص مترجم تخصصی</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">انتخاب مترجم حرفه‌ای با تخصص در حوزه محتوای شما</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white/80 rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-green-700\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">ترجمه اولیه و کنترل کیفیت</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">ترجمه توسط مترجم و بررسی کیفیت توسط متخصص زبان‌شناسی</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 p-6 bg-white/80 rounded-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-green-700\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">بومی‌سازی و نهایی‌سازی</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">انطباق فرهنگی، کنترل نهایی و تحویل محصول</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">سوالات <span class=\"gradient-text\">متداول</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">پاسخ به پرسش‌های رایج مشتریان درباره خدمات ترجمه</p></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>چه زبان‌هایی را پوشش می‌دهید؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">انگلیسی، عربی، فرانسوی، ترکی، آلمانی، ایتالیایی، روسی، کره‌ای، ژاپنی و سایر زبان‌های اصلی دنیا را پوشش می‌دهیم. اگر زبان خاصی نیاز دارید، در زمان مشاوره بررسی خواهیم کرد.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>آیا محتوای تخصصی هم ترجمه می‌کنید؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بله، این یکی از تخصص‌های اصلی ماست. مقالات علمی، متون فنی و تخصصی توسط مترجمین حوزه مربوطه (پزشکی، مهندسی، حقوق و غیره) ترجمه می‌شود.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>زمان تحویل ترجمه به چه صورت است؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بسته به حجم و زبان، معمولاً ۳ روز تا یک هفته. برای پروژه‌های اورژانسی، خدمات سریع‌العمل در دسترس است. زمان دقیق هنگام ثبت سفارش اعلام خواهد شد.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>چطور کیفیت ترجمه را تضمین می‌کنید؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">تمام ترجمه‌ها از دو مرحله کنترل کیفیت عبور می‌کنند: ۱) کنترل توسط مترجم تخصصی، ۲) بازبینی توسط متخصص زبان‌شناسی. همچنین با هفت روز گارانتی کیفیت رسپانس هستیم.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>آیا سئو در ترجمه‌ها رعایت می‌شود؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بله، متخصصین ما با دانش سئوی بین‌المللی کار می‌کنند. کلمات کلیدی استراتژیک حفظ شده، ساختار محتوا بهینه‌سازی می‌شود و برای موتورهای جستجوی محلی آماده می‌گردد.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>هزینه ترجمه چگونه محاسبه می‌شود؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بر اساس زبان، حوزه تخصصی، تعداد کلمات و زمان تحویل. پکیج‌های مختلفی داریم که از اقتصادی تا VIP. ریچمپ دقیق در زمان ارائه مشاوره اعلام خواهد شد.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white\"><div class=\"container-custom text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">زبان مرز نمی‌شناسد، کسب‌وکار شما را جهانی کنید!</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto opacity-90\">با مترجمین تخصصی عصر سئو، محتوای شما به زبان‌های زنده دنیا ترجمه شود و به بازارهای میلیونی دسترسی پیدا کنید. از تحلیل فرهنگی تا بهینه‌سازی سئو چندزبانه، ما در کنار شما هستیم.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-11 rounded-md px-8 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white\">شروع ترجمه حرفه‌ای</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border bg-background h-11 rounded-md px-8 border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-slate-900\">مشاوره رایگان ترجمه</button></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 space-x-reverse\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-asre-blue-500 to-asre-green-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><sp